<h2>Just double-checking...</h2>

<p>
  Please complete the quick hCaptcha below so we know you're not a robot! You only need to do this once, and if you <%= link_to "sign in", new_user_session_path %>, you can skip this step entirely.
  <br /><br />
</p>

<p>
  Mapwarper.net runs on volunteer effort and is currently under a lot of load due to bots and scrapers which have taken the site offline sometimes. Sorry for all the fuss! 
</p>


<form action="/verify-human" method="post">
  <%= hidden_field_tag :authenticity_token, form_authenticity_token %>
  <%= hidden_field_tag :return_to, params[:return_to] %>

  <% if ENV["HCAPTCHA_SITE_KEY"] %>
    <%= hcaptcha_tags %>
  <% end %>

  <button type="submit">Continue</button>
</form>
